              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi muŋanda iisalalisya yamukati wakabeza bakerebimu bobile bazisamu akubaziluluzya ingolida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mababa aabakerebimu, bulamfu bwao bwakali tukokola tuli makumi obile, Ibbaba limwi lyakerebimu litaanzi lyakali abulamfu bwatukokola tosanwe, lyakali kwaampa bulambo bwaŋanda, alyalo ibbaba limwi lyakali abulamfu bwatukokola tosanwe, lyakali kuswanana abbaba lyakerebimunyina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbubonya obo, ibaaba lyakerebimu wabili lyakali abulamfu bwatukokola tosanwe, lyakali kwaampa bulambo bwaŋanda, abbaba limwi lyakali abulamfu bwatukokola tosanwe, lyakali kuswanana abbaba lyakerebimunyina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mababa oonse aabakerebimu aba akasika kubulamfu bwatukokola tuli makumi obile naakatandabede. Bakaliimvwi amaulu aabo, alimwi masyu aabo akalilangene aŋanda yamukati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
